    "A skill is a procedure the assistant loads when a task matches its description, and then follows. It never approves an action: commands, writes and transfers still ask exactly as they would otherwise." : {
      "comment" : "A description of what a skill is.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技能是一段流程：当任务与它的描述相符时，助手会加载并遵循它。技能不会批准任何操作，命令、写入与传输仍会照常请求许可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技能是一段流程：當任務與它的描述相符時，助手會載入並遵循它。技能不會核准任何操作，指令、寫入與傳輸仍會照常請求許可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
