    "Delete saved memory, snapshots, learning progress, and search indexes, then turn off Memory. Skills and chat history are kept. Re-enabling Memory can rebuild memories from old chats." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除已保存的记忆、快照、学习进度和搜索索引，并关闭记忆功能。技能和聊天记录将保留。重新启用后，可能从旧聊天中重新建立记忆。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除已儲存的記憶、快照、學習進度和搜尋索引，並關閉記憶功能。技能和聊天紀錄將保留。重新啟用後，可能從舊聊天中重新建立記憶。"
          }
